## 八、8.6 综合实例：个人银行账户管理程序（多态版）

第 7 讲遗留的三个痛点一次解决：Account 升级为**抽象基类**（纯虚 settle/withdraw），基类指针数组统一遍历结算，友元 operator<< 输出，虚析构兜底（demo08e 实跑）。

```cpp
class Account {
private:
    int id;
    double balance;
protected:
    void record(double amount) { balance += amount; }   // 派生类记账口子
public:
    Account(int id, double balance = 0) : id(id), balance(balance) {}
    int getId() const { return id; }
    double getBalance() const { return balance; }

    virtual bool withdraw(double amount) = 0;   // 纯虚：取款规则各不相同
    virtual void settle() = 0;                  // 纯虚：结算方式各不相同
    virtual ~Account() = default;               // 虚析构：delete 基类指针的安全网

    friend ostream& operator<<(ostream& os, const Account& a);   // 友元输出
};

ostream& operator<<(ostream& os, const Account& a) {
    return os << "[账户#" << a.id << " 余额=" << fixed << setprecision(2) << a.balance << "]";
}

class SavingsAccount : public Account {
    double rate;
public:
    SavingsAccount(int id, double rate, double balance = 0)
        : Account(id, balance), rate(rate) {}
    bool withdraw(double amount) override {
        if (amount > getBalance()) return false;    // 不许透支
        record(-amount);
        return true;
    }
    void settle() override {
        double interest = getBalance() * rate;
        record(interest);
        cout << "  结算: 账户#" << getId() << " 利息 +" << interest << endl;
    }
};

class CreditAccount : public Account {
    double credit, rate;
public:
    CreditAccount(int id, double credit, double rate, double balance = 0)
        : Account(id, balance), credit(credit), rate(rate) {}
    bool withdraw(double amount) override {
        if (getBalance() - amount < -credit) return false;   // 可透支到 -credit
        record(-amount);
        return true;
    }
    void settle() override {                                  // 欠款计息
        double interest = getBalance() < 0 ? getBalance() * rate : 0;
        record(interest);
        cout << "  结算: 账户#" << getId() << " 欠款计息 " << (interest < 0 ? interest : 0) << endl;
    }
};

int main() {
    SavingsAccount sa(1, 0.015, 10000);
    CreditAccount  ca(2, 10000, 0.0005);

    vector<Account*> accounts = { &sa, &ca };   // 类型兼容：统一容器
    accounts[0]->withdraw(3000);                // 动态绑定 -> SavingsAccount::withdraw
    accounts[1]->withdraw(5000);                // 动态绑定 -> CreditAccount::withdraw
    for (Account* p : accounts) p->settle();    // 一句循环，两种结算

    Account* heap = new SavingsAccount(3, 0.02, 500);
    delete heap;                                // 虚析构保证完整析构
    return 0;
}
```

真实输出：

```text
== 开户 ==
  [账户#1 余额=10000.00] 利率=1.50%
  [账户#2 余额=0.00]

== 全年操作（经 Account* 统一入口）==
  取款失败: 账户#2 超额度
  [账户#1 余额=7000.00]
  [账户#2 余额=-5000.00]

== 年底统一结算（一句循环，两种行为）==
  结算: 账户#1 利息 +105.00
  结算: 账户#2 欠款计息 -2.50
  [账户#1 余额=7105.00]
  [账户#2 余额=-5002.50]

== 虚析构验证：heap 上的账户经基类指针 delete ==
  new SavingsAccount#3 完成
  delete 经 Account* 完成（~SavingsAccount -> ~Account 顺序执行）
```

对比第 7 讲版本的三处升级：① withdraw 的规则由**对象实际类型**决定（第 7 讲经 `Account*` 只能调基类版）；② Account 不能再有"笼统的默认行为"，settle/withdraw 纯虚，逼每个派生类表态；③ 新增账户类型只需再派生一个类实现两个纯虚函数，主循环**一行不改** —— 这就是"对扩展开放、对修改关闭"。


:::callout note open 套路总结
与上面 8.5 的梯形积分完全同构：**抽象基类 + 纯虚接口 + 算法只认基类引用/指针**。教材 8.5（积分换被积函数）与 8.6（主循环换账户类型）两例、乃至全书后面很多设计，都是这一个模式。
:::
